hat’s out in the open.\n\nhttps://t.co/jUEtTx9bB5","url":"https://x.com/tedlieu/status/1637837943439077379"},{"author_id":"21059255","conversation_id":"1637835987874136071","created_at":"2023-03-20T15:18:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1637835987874136071"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/atrupar/status…","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/atrupar/status/1637826603978838016","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/of5Sm02Inm"}]},"id":"1637835987874136071","text":"I can’t believe I need to say this, but all prosecutors are funded by taxes, not by any particular person.\n\nAlso, to answer the question by DeSantis about Trump’s conduct, I note that Michael Cohen went to prison in part for participating in hush money payments to a porn star. https://t.co/of5Sm02Inm","url":"https://x.com/tedlieu/status/1637835987874136071"},{"author_id":"21059255","conversation_id":"1637557222526930944","created_at":"2023-03-19T21:59:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1637574476727570434"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":12,"id":"1605549495139405824","start":0,"username":"KeePerl1942"},{"end":27,"id":"71627462","start":13,"username":"JonahDispatch"}]},"id":"1637574476727570434","text":"@KeePerl1942 @JonahDispatch Michael Cohen was convicted of a felony for participating in hush money payments to Stormy Daniels. Go look it up.","url":"https://x.com/tedlieu/status/1637574476727570434"},{"author_id":"21059255","conversation_id":"1637557222526930944","created_at":"2023-03-19T20:50:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1637557222526930944"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":19,"id":"71627462","start":5,"username":"JonahDispatch"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/trumpwarroom/s…","end":230,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/trumpwarroom/status/1637474764473155585","start":207,"url":"https://t.co/NJyyNMtyO8"}]},"id":"1637557222526930944","text":"Dear @JonahDispatch: What if Donald Trump’s name was Michael Cohen? Because a person named Michael Cohen was prosecuted and served prison ti